 "words": 231,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Consider it nothing but joy, my brothers",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When trials of every kind come your way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Testing of your faith produces endurance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let it finish its work today",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you may be mature and complete",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lacking nothing in the heart",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you lack wisdom, do not fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just turn to where the light is start",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask God, who gives generously to all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without finding fault, He will not fail",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It will be given to him, it will be given to him",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask in faith, keep your heart from strife",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But let him ask in faith, without doubting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the one who doubts is like a wave",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Driven and tossed by the wind",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unstable in all he does and saves",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask God, who gives generously to all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without finding fault, He will not fail",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It will be given to him, it will be given to him",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask in faith, keep your heart from strife",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Such a person should not expect to receive anything",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the Lord, for double-minded minds are blind",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be tossed about by the wind",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand firm in the truth you will find",
